SUMMARY:Out & About at Dram & Draught
DESCRIPTION:We’re back with our friends at Dram & Draught! Come visit with a few of our adoptable dogs and order a cocktail made with Tito’s Handmade Vodka — they’ll donate $1 to APS for each one! Grab a few friends and come hang out with us on the patio. See you there!
URL:https://www.apsofdurham.org/event/out-about-at-dram-draught-8/
LOCATION:Dram & Draught\, 701 W Main St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Adoption Events,Fundraisers
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.apsofdurham.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/0509-Dram-Draught.jpg
END:VEVENT
